{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07456","headline":"赴南中题褚少府湖上亭子 · 刘长卿","name":"赴南中题褚少府湖上亭子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"种田东郭傍春陂，万事无情把钓丝。\n绿竹放侵行径里，青山常对卷帘时。\n纷纷花落门空闭，寂寂莺啼日更迟。\n从此别君千万里，白云流水忆佳期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘长卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07456.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07456","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}